# Pin this project to the public registry.
#
# The machine this was built on has a corporate Nexus mirror in ~/.npmrc, which
# rewrote every `resolved` URL in package-lock.json to a host that needs
# credentials. The Docker build (and therefore the Render deploy) has neither
# those credentials nor a route to that host, so `npm ci` failed with a 401
# inside the container while working fine outside it. Pinning here keeps the
# lockfile portable no matter whose machine runs `npm install` next.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
